                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.6831/197: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Greece</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">MacVeagh</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-04-28T12:00:00+02:00">April 28,
                        1938—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received April 28—9:25 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>29. Department’s instruction No. 454, April 13. New <hi rendition="#italic">modus
                        vivendi</hi> submitted this morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacVeagh</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
